---
import FormationGraphic from './FormationGraphic.astro';
---

<section class="architectural-grid section-y border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-primary)]">
  <div class="editorial-container">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span class="eyebrow-pill">
            <span class="inline-block size-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent-signal)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            THE VISIBLE AGENT • ORIENTATION IN CHAOS
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="h1 mb-7 max-w-[14.5ch] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          Everything is moving faster. But who has <em>wise hands at the wheel?</em>
        </h1>

        <div class="mb-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-signal)] pl-5 sm:pl-6">
          <p class="font-editorial text-2xl leading-snug text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">
            <strong class="font-normal text-[var(--accent-signal)]">Find formation.</strong> Better decisions in a world of accelerating possibilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="p-body mb-10 max-w-[58ch]">
          We have never had more capability. But capability without direction creates confusion. We help capable people cut through organisational noise, coordinate human judgement, and move together with conviction.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-7">
          <a
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center bg-[var(--accent-signal)] px-7 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-on-accent)] no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--accent-signal-hover)]"
            href="#book"
          >
            Start a Conversation <span class="ml-2.5" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a
            class="group text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] underline decoration-[var(--accent-ochre)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-[var(--accent-signal)]"
            href="/about"
          >
            Read the 5-Part Narrative <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <FormationGraphic variant="hero" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-px border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--border-subtle)] sm:mt-20 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-7">
        <p class="technical-label mb-2 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-[var(--accent-signal)]">01 / ORIENTATION</p>
        <p class="font-editorial mb-1.5 text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-2xl">Visibility creates orientation.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--text-muted)]">A clear, unmistakable point of reference when signals get crossed and noise masquerades as urgency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-7">
        <p class="technical-label mb-2 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-[var(--accent-signal)]">02 / COORDINATION</p>
        <p class="font-editorial mb-1.5 text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-2xl">Wise hands at the wheel.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--text-muted)]">Calm, seasoned practitioner judgement rooted in human behaviour—not abstract theory or algorithmic hype.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-7">
        <p class="technical-label mb-2 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-[var(--accent-signal)]">03 / INDEPENDENCE</p>
        <p class="font-editorial mb-1.5 text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-2xl">Useful, never indispensable.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--text-muted)]">Steady hands when it matters. Once your team has formation and conviction, we step aside.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>